  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>H2S Algebraic 06 - 不等于条件</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[
        <p>为了使下面的式子有定义，请写出 \(x\) 需要满足的限制条件：</p>
        <p>\[\frac{x+2}{x-2}\]</p>
        <p>请将答案写成“不等于”的形式。</p>
        <p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
      ]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>分母不能为零，所以 \(x\ne2\)。</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <questionvariables>
      <text>ta1:x#2;</text>
    </questionvariables>
    <specificfeedback format="html">
      <text>[[feedback:prt1]]</text>
    </specificfeedback>
    <questionnote format="html">
      <text>H2S-algebraic-not-equal-v1</text>
    </questionnote>
    <input>
      <name>ans1</name>
      <type>algebraic</type>
      <tans>ta1</tans>
      <boxsize>24</boxsize>
      <strictsyntax>1</strictsyntax>
      <insertstars>0</insertstars>
      <forbidfloat>1</forbidfloat>
